\\\\"January 25, 2026\\\\\\\"\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"readTime: \\\\\\\"7 min read\\\\\\\"\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"author: \\\\\\\"Nebulaa Team\\\\\\\"\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"5\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h1\\\",\\\"6\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Nebulaa vs Clay: Two Approaches to AI-Powered Lead Generation\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"7\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"8\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Clay has become one of the most talked-about tools in GTM circles over the last two years — and for good reason. If you want to build a hyper-personalised outbound list at scale, enriching each lead with 10+ data points and writing personalised first lines using AI, Clay is genuinely impressive.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"9\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"10\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"But it's a power tool. And like most power tools, it requires a skilled operator, considerable setup time, and an understanding of what it can and can't do on its own.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"11\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"12\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Here's a full comparison of how Clay and Nebulaa approach AI-powered lead generation — and why for most Indian founders, the tools aren't really competing for the same use case.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"13\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"14\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"What Clay Does Well\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"15\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"16\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Clay is a data enrichment and sequencing platform. At its core, you build a table of leads and then run a waterfall of data enrichment on each row: LinkedIn profile, company headcount, recent funding, tech stack, hiring signals, and more. The AI then uses all this data to write personalised outreach messages at scale.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"17\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"18\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The results can be impressive. A well-built Clay workflow can take 500 raw company names and produce 500 personalised outreach emails in a few hours — each one referencing something specific about the company that makes it feel handcrafted.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"19\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"20\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"For sales teams at B2B SaaS companies targeting US or European enterprise buyers — Clay is a serious competitive advantage.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"21\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"22\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"**Clay genuinely excels at**:\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"23\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Data enrichment at scale (pulling from 50+ sources)\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"24\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Waterfall enrichment (try source A, fall back to B, then C)\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"25\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Hyper-personalised first lines for cold email\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"26\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Building complex lead scoring logic\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"27\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Integrating with outbound tools like Instantly or Smartlead\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"28\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"29\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"What Clay Doesn't Do\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"30\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"31\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Clay is a data and enrichment tool. It doesn't:\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"32\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"33\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Make phone calls\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"34\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Send WhatsApp messages\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"35\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Have a conversation with a lead in real time\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"36\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Qualify a lead through a live interaction\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"37\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Generate or publish social content\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"38\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Learn your brand voice and post daily\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"39\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"40\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The output of a Clay workflow is typically a CSV or a CRM-ready list, or it feeds into a separate sequencing tool. The \\\\\\\"follow-up\\\\\\\" in Clay's world is an email sequence — automated, but one-way. A lead replies, and now a human needs to pick it up.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"41\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"42\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"For Indian SMB and D2C contexts, this creates a practical problem. Email open rates for Indian B2B are often 20–25%. Clay-powered cold email sequences hit low reply rates on Indian leads because the channel is less effective than in US markets. The enrichment is excellent; the delivery mechanism is suboptimal for the Indian context.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"43\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"44\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"And the setup complexity is significant. Clay has a steep learning curve. Most founders who try to use it independently spend 2–3 weeks building their first workflow. Many hire a Clay specialist.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"45\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"46\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Where Nebulaa's Pulsar Is Different\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"47\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"48\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Pulsar doesn't enrich 500 leads with 10 data points each. It takes your leads and calls them.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"49\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"50\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"This sounds simple. It's not. A real-time voice conversation with a lead — even an AI-powered one — does something no email sequence can do: it creates a two-way interaction in the moment. The lead responds. They ask questions. They reveal their actual situation. They either commit or they decline clearly.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"51\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"52\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The qualification signal from a 2-minute Pulsar call is far more reliable than the engagement signal from an opened email. By the end of the call, you know: is this lead ready to buy, not ready but interested, or clearly not a fit? That's information you can act on immediately.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"53\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"54\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Pulsar then routes accordingly: warm leads get a calendar link, nurture leads go into a WhatsApp sequence, and unfit leads are documented and archived.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"55\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"56\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Feature Comparison\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"57\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"72\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"73\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"When to Use Clay\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"74\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"75\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Use Clay when:\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"76\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"77\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"You have a trained operator or are willing to invest 2–3 weeks in setup\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"78\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"You're doing high-volume outbound to US or European markets where email still works\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"79\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Your sales team needs a constant stream of enriched, personalised leads fed into a sequencing tool\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"80\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"You have a CRM and existing outbound stack that Clay can plug into\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"81\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Your ICP is well-defined and you need data enrichment to identify and prioritise the right accounts\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"82\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"83\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"When to Use Nebulaa\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"84\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"85\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Use Nebulaa when:\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"86\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"87\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"You're selling in India where WhatsApp and calls outperform cold email\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"88\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"You're a small team or solo founder without a dedicated SDR or Clay specialist\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"89\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"You need leads to be qualified through actual conversations, not just tagged as \\\\\\\"opened email\\\\\\\"\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"90\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"You want content (Gravity) and outreach (Pulsar) to work as one connected system\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"91\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Speed of setup matters — Pulsar is running your first campaign within a day\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"92\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"93\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Can You Use Both?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"94\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"95\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Yes, and some teams do. Clay for list building and enrichment → export to Pulsar for calling and qualification. This gives you Clay's enrichment quality with Pulsar's Indian-market-optimised outreach. It's a more advanced setup, but it works well for teams that have found PMF and are scaling outbound.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"96\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"97\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"ch